{"id":"72d75ef05bc21baa","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence.md","title":"值相容性本身不强制停机","display":"ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence — 值相容性本身不强制停机","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence","aliases":["72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence"],"display":"ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence — 值相容性本身不强制停机","depends_on":["[[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X PER abstraction; local minimal divergence example","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence — 值相容性本身不强制停机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81bf35e8ff6390c3\" href=\"?note=81bf35e8ff6390c3\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-live-support\">72-thm-preevaluation-live-support</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X PER abstraction; local minimal divergence example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPER}\">\\(\\operatorname{VPER}\\)</span>、预求值扩张与支撑取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81bf35e8ff6390c3\" href=\"?note=81bf35e8ff6390c3\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-live-support\">72-thm-preevaluation-live-support</a> 的接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:=\\{d\\}\">\\(T:=\\{d\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Downarrow:=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Downarrow:=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span>。确定性与幂等求值条件在空关系上成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R:=\\{\\langle d,d\\rangle\\},\\qquad R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e),\\qquad\n|R|=\\{d\\},\\qquad R^\\Downarrow=\\varnothing\\ne R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R:=\\{\\langle d,d\\rangle\\},\\qquad R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e),\\qquad\n|R|=\\{d\\},\\qquad R^\\Downarrow=\\varnothing\\ne R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>d没有值；Kleene相等仍自反，单元素全关系当然饱和。没有求值见证时预求值扩张为空。此例只检查当前抽象PER接口的边界，不声称该单元素求值结构实现了完整 Nuprl 的计算构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-live-support","status":"resolved","id":"81bf35e8ff6390c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-live-support","status":"resolved","id":"81bf35e8ff6390c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VPER}$、预求值扩张与支撑取 [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] 的接口。$T:=\\{d\\}$，$\\Downarrow:=\\varnothing$，$\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$。确定性与幂等求值条件在空关系上成立。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPER}","display":false},{"tex":"T:=\\{d\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Downarrow:=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"R:=\\{\\langle d,d\\rangle\\},\\qquad R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e),\\qquad\n|R|=\\{d\\},\\qquad R^\\Downarrow=\\varnothing\\ne R.","display":true}],"bytes":1439,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation